    "cf9dc11a-fc55-47d0-b33a-b31e463672ad": {
      "type": "section-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_j7Dkyw": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/BDAY-PHOTO-2019-1-sized_2.jpg",
            "title": "Stephanie S. - Force-free Dog Trainer & Certified Canine Nutritionist",
            "text": "<p>For nearly 20 years, Stephanie has been on a journey of teaching humans. Now she teaches humans and their four legged companions together. With a background in physiology, psychology, holistic health, nutrition, herbalism, trauma, neuroscience and neuroethology, Stephanie shows her clients how to cultivate a happy, healthy, and harmonized hound and life together.</p><ul><li>Certified Dog Behavior Consultant</li><li>CPCN, CHES, CCDT</li><li>Feed Real Institute (CPCN)</li></ul>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "af2bf11c-a968-4321-b1a9-b76e5c7073ea": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image0_7.jpg",
            "title": "Shannen S. - Force-free Dog Trainer",
            "text": "<p>Shannen is a passionate trainer working to better the lives of dogs and their owners using positive, science-backed methods that revolve around patience, love, and positivity. She is Certified in Applied Animal Behavior which focuses on behavior ethology, learning theory, and the biology behind training and how it relates to companion animals. Her mission is to educate owners on how to understand their dog on a deeper level in order to create a bond that they’ve always dreamed of.<br/><br/>Certifications</p><ul><li>UW-AAB </li><li>Applied Animal Behavior - University of Washington</li><li>AKC Good Citizen Evaluator<br/></li></ul>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "https://youtube.com/shorts/wUF5lQCr97U?feature=share",
            "video_link_color": "text-light"
          }
        },
        "text_block_VqY8eG": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_5371.jpg",
            "title": "Jennifer F - Veterinary Technician & Force-free Dog Trainer",
            "text": "<p>With a deep understanding of animal behavior & care honed through extensive experience in veterinary medicine, the retail pet space, and academic study, Jennifer is a Certified Professional Dog Trainer and Fear Free Certified Veterinary Partner dedicated to helping pets and their humans live enriched lives together. Her passion for rational, logical communication and ability to offer practical solutions ensures a seamless integration of training into daily life, leading to happy and harmonious relationships.</p><ul><li>Certified Fear Free Dog Trainer - Level 3 & Avian Pet Professional Guild Member</li><li>Masters-level Veterinary Education</li><li>BSc Neurobiology, Physiology and Behavior</li></ul>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "text_block_D8bBUp": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/BDAY-PHOTO-2019-1-sized.jpg",
            "title": "Stephanie S. - Force-free Dog Trainer, Nutritionist, Herbalist",
            "text": "<p>For nearly 20 years, Stephanie has drawn from her background in physiology, psychology, holistic health, nutrition, herbalism, trauma, neuroscience within the canine ecosystem. As a trauma-informed pet professional, Stephanie practices and promotes self-awareness and empowerment as a means to strengthen behavior and wellness outcomes, showing her clients how to cultivate a happy, healthy, and harmonized hound and life together.</p><p>Certifications</p><ul><li>M.Ed, CPCN, CHES, CCDT</li><li>Fear Free Certified</li><li>Dog Bite Prevention Educator</li><li>Certified-AKC Evaluator</li><li>Certified Professional Canine Nutritionist</li></ul>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "template--16036805083322__cf9dc11a-fc55-47d0-b33a-b31e463672ad-1677351842118d106c-2": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2023-06-02_at_11.23.15_AM.png",
            "title": "Juju - Grooming Expert",
            "text": "<p>Juju is passionate about changing how your pet experiences grooming at home, she uses a fear-free grooming approach to create a positive, minimally invasive experience for your dogs. With her over a decade of experience, her grooming salons and practices have been featured in GQ and Vogue. Juju's innovative breed-specific techniques are designed to reduce pet anxiety and help maintain your dog's groom with proper and safe upkeep at home.</p><p>Experience:</p><ul><li>Owner - Juju Grooms Pet Grooming, Toronto</li><li>Master Certified Feline Groomer</li></ul>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "template--16036805083322__cf9dc11a-fc55-47d0-b33a-b31e463672ad-1677351842118d106c-3": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/walking.jpg",
            "title": "Emily L. - Nutrition Specialist",
            "text": "<p>Emily is a pet nutritionist with a specialty in holistic animal wellness who dove head first into the field after her dog Hans became ill. With a specialty incorporating herbs, traditional Chinese medicine principles and other alternative and functional healing modalities, Emily’s expertise has transformed dog’s lives through the power of nutrition. </p><p>Certifications: </p><ul><li>DNM University - Certified Pet Food Nutrition Specialist</li></ul>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "https://youtu.be/Cu6XU0fwQ04",
            "video_link_color": "text-light"
          }
        },
        "template--16036805083322__cf9dc11a-fc55-47d0-b33a-b31e463672ad-1677351842118d106c-1": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2023-06-02_at_11.22.42_AM.png",
            "title": "Ashwini A. - Force-free Dog Trainer & Behavior Specialist",
            "text": "<p>Ashwini is a power house within the force free dog training community. With 14 years of training experience, she has devoted her career to dogs from training to pet rescue and relocation. Armed with multiple certifications, she has successfully conducted thousands of online training sessions addressing a wide range of behavioral issues with a minimally invasive approach that continues to change lives. </p><p>Certifications: </p><ul><li>Cambridge Institute of Canine Behaviour and Training</li><li>Brenda Aloff Fundamentals Instructor Certification</li></ul>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "https://youtu.be/-dJkSc1jzpA",
            "video_link_color": "text-light"
          }
        },
        "dd00b393-a662-4339-9905-29bcc98ff16c": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/MG_6479-Edit-2_FINALS.jpg",
            "title": "Gabriela B. - Pet-friendly Interior Expert",
            "text": "<p>Gabriela founded LAY LO in 2017 to bring great design to pet products in the home. After forging dozens of partnerships with interior designers and starting her own design firm, Gabriela is here to help you create a space you and your dog will love. </p><p>Certifications:</p><ul><li>RISD / Brown Design Degree</li><li>Design Leading Lady Honoree by PSFK</li><li>Shoptalk Design Education Certificate </li></ul>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "text_block_YhRtqG": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/553BB7DC-1396-41B7-A583-241A931639D4.jpg",
            "title": "Jeny P. - Fear-free Dog Trainer",
            "text": "<p>Jeny's true passion and joy are in helping dog parents develop happy, healthy, and harmonious friendships with their dogs that will last a lifetime. Driven by her genuine love for dogs, Jeny is committed to strengthening the human-canine bond and helping families achieve their dream life<br/>with their dogs. </p><p>Certifications:</p><ul><li>CPDT-KA </li><li>Certified Professional Dog Trainer-Knowledge Assessed</li></ul>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        }
      },
