    "8cc69ca8-3815-400e-9908-b91856bd1c07": {
      "type": "section-icons-row",
      "blocks": {
        "493f3f79-7fae-471a-994d-40273ccc3877": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "check",
            "title": "Reduced Distractions",
            "text": "<p>With virtual training, your puppy can focus. Training in your dog’s home environment without new smells and distractions is proven to drive faster long-term results. </p>"
          }
        },
        "41d616c3-2224-4f58-b794-20d02f788224": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "heart",
            "title": "Increased Safety",
            "text": "<p>Unvaccinated pups are vulnerable to dangerous illnesses like parvo and distemper which makes enrolling in puppy classes a big no no. With Homeschool virtual dog training, you can start as early as 8-weeks and know that your pup is safe. </p>"
          }
        },
        "378c64ed-8360-479a-818b-274a1dbd6371": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "eco-friendly",
            "title": "Build your Bond",
            "text": "<p>Puppies go through multiple fear periods in the first year where training regresses because they are unsure of their surroundings. By training in your dog’s “safe space”, you are making the process less overwhelming for them (and you!)</p>"
          }
        },
        "cff8bb63-a14d-4801-b95a-e391b0b6f670": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "award",
            "title": "Guaranteed Results",
            "text": "<p>If you are not satisfied with your puppy's progress after the program, we will give you your money back* OR continue to train with you for 4 more weeks free of cost.</p>"
          }
        },
        "2dc52604-a9da-485a-862c-13dcbedadbcd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "clock",
            "title": "Prevent Puppy Problems",
            "text": "<p>With virtual, you can start as early as 8-weeks (instead of the typical 16), ensuring that your dog is beginning training during their prime weeks of learning and development. </p>"
          }
        },
        "af90b4af-932d-4481-b23d-21c04cb61b49": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "smile",
            "title": "Affordable 1:1 Training",
            "text": "<p>Private in person training can be expensive costing between $100-$250 / session. With this program, you'll get personalized live support from the comfort of your home. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
