          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text_position": "left",
            "top_image_width": 100,
            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "What's Included",
            "title": "Puppy Program All-Access",
            "text": "<p><strong>Message on-demand with certified  dog experts and get 1:1 help twice a week. </strong></p><p>✅ Lifetime access to 40+ puppy courses</p><p>✅ 1-month access to our text-a-trainer SMS service</p><p>✅ 8x 15-min video sessions with your trainer</p><p></p><p><strong>- B O N U S -</strong></p><p></p><p>✅ Free 30-min Behavior Evaluation <strong>[$49 Value]</strong></p><p>✅ 10% Off Premium 1:1 Training Packages <strong>[$125 Value]</strong></p><p>✅ 15% Off LAY LO™ Brand Products <strong>[$35 Value]</strong></p><p>✅ Homeschool Training Satisfaction Guarantee </p><h4></h4><h4><strong>Total Cost: $199 ($475 Value) </strong></h4>",
            "button_text": "Purchase the Puppy Program",
            "button_link": "https://homeschoolbylaylo.podia.com/membershiplibrary/buy",
            "button_style": "btn--primary",
            "secondary_button_text": "",
